  "answer": "**答案：2028 年。**\n\n在 2026 年 10 月 15 日于德州 Waco 举办的 Roadster 发布会上，马斯克说新一代 Roadster 会在 2028 年投产。有一家媒体引述他的另一个说法：\"演示之后大约一年左右\"开始生产。这个说法跟 2028 年不太一致。另外，这辆车之前已经多次延期。\n\n搜索次数：1 次。\n\nSources:\n- [CNBC: Tesla unveils long-delayed Roadster developed with SpaceX](https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/15/tesla-roadster-reveal-what-to-know-about-the-delayed-ev.html)\n- [Engadget: The Tesla Roadster should go into production in 2028](https://www.engadget.com/2289475/tesla-roadster-2028-production-dont-get-hopes-up/)\n- [Statesman: Tesla's new Roadster unveiling event in Texas](https://www.statesman.com/business/article/tesla-roadster-event-live-texas-mcgregor-22433111.php)",
